                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How long before content shows results?</h3>
                                        <p>12-24 months to meaningful organic traffic. 24-48 months to category authority. Not for impatient brands.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I use AI to write content?</h3>
                                        <p>As first-draft accelerator + editorial acceleration — yes. As unedited final publish — no. Google + AI search penalize low-effort AI content.</p>
                                        <h3>What is GEO?</h3>
                                        <p>Generative Engine Optimization — optimising content for AI search citation (ChatGPT + Perplexity + Google AI Overviews + Claude). Complements traditional SEO.</p>
                                        <h3>How much should I spend on content?</h3>
